# WildFly
# website: https://www.wildfly.org
# docs: https://docs.wildfly.org
# description: WildFly, JBoss AS 7+ and JBoss EAP standalone and domain mode runtime data, logs, temp directories, configuration history, and deployment scanner markers

# Standalone mode runtime
**/standalone/data/
**/standalone/log/
**/standalone/tmp/
**/standalone/configuration/standalone_xml_history/

# Domain mode runtime
**/domain/data/
**/domain/log/
**/domain/tmp/
**/domain/servers/
**/domain/configuration/domain_xml_history/
**/domain/configuration/host_xml_history/

# Deployment scanner markers
**/standalone/deployments/*.dodeploy
**/standalone/deployments/*.skipdeploy
**/standalone/deployments/*.isdeploying
**/standalone/deployments/*.deployed
**/standalone/deployments/*.failed
**/standalone/deployments/*.isundeploying
**/standalone/deployments/*.undeployed
**/standalone/deployments/*.pending